    "updated_at": "2021-03-16T15:08:04Z",
    "body": "There's also the case of navigations that fail the [allowed to navigate](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/browsers.html#allowed-to-navigate) test. Again, it feels like we should cancel the whole traversal if any part of it is not allowed.",
